IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CHECK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N0 USAGE POINTER.
01 N1 USAGE POINTER.
01 N1-V PIC X(16) VALUE "C:\path\to\file" & X"00".
01 N2 USAGE POINTER.
01 N2-V PIC X(12) VALUE "back\\slash" & X"00".
01 N3 USAGE POINTER.
01 N3-V PIC X(16) VALUE "hello \""world\""" & X"00".
01 N4 USAGE POINTER.
01 N4-V PIC X(16) VALUE "path\to ""# file" & X"00".
01 N5 USAGE POINTER.
01 N5-V PIC X(10) VALUE "trailing\" & X"00".
01 N6 USAGE POINTER.
01 N6-V PIC X(21) VALUE "both ""quotes''' here" & X"00".
01 N7 USAGE POINTER.
01 N7-V PIC X(26) VALUE "line1\nline2" & X"0A" & "with newline" & X"00".
01 N-STATUS PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 MY-DATA USAGE POINTER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateArray" RETURNING N0.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N1-V RETURNING N1.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N1 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N2-V RETURNING N2.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N2 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N3-V RETURNING N3.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N3 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N4-V RETURNING N4.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N4 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N5-V RETURNING N5.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N5 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N6-V RETURNING N6.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N6 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    CALL "cJSON_CreateString" USING BY REFERENCE N7-V RETURNING N7.
    CALL "cJSON_AddItemToArray" USING BY VALUE N0 BY VALUE N7 RETURNING N-STATUS.
    SET MY-DATA TO N0.
    STOP RUN.
